sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant KB as 物理键盘
    participant Browser as 浏览器
    participant HookMap as useKeyboardMap
    participant BKB as BubbleKeyboard
    participant Key as BubbleKey
    participant Audio as useAudioEngine
    participant WebAudio as Web Audio API
    participant Particle as ParticleBurst
    participant HookDrag as useDragPop
    participant CSS as CSS Animations

    %% ==================== 流程1: 物理键盘触发爆破 ====================
    rect rgb(30, 10, 40)
        Note over User,CSS: 流程1 — 物理键盘触发爆破（keydown → pop → respawn）
        User->>KB: 敲击 KeyQ
        KB->>Browser: keydown { code: "KeyQ" }
        Browser->>HookMap: event.code === "KeyQ"
        HookMap->>HookMap: activeKeys.has("KeyQ")? 否 → 继续
        HookMap->>HookMap: codeToKey["KeyQ"] → KeyConfig
        HookMap->>HookMap: activeKeys.add("KeyQ")
        HookMap->>BKB: onKeyPop(keyConfig)

        rect rgb(40, 20, 60)
            Note over BKB,CSS: 爆破处理
            BKB->>Audio: playPop({ baseFrequency: 4000±20%, duration: 100ms })
            Audio->>WebAudio: createBufferSource(noiseBuffer)
            Audio->>WebAudio: createBiquadFilter(bandpass, 2000-8000Hz)
            Audio->>WebAudio: createGain(exponentialRampToValueAtTime, 0, 100ms)
            Audio->>WebAudio: source.start(0)
            WebAudio-->>User: 🔊 "啪" 爆破音

            BKB->>BKB: keysPhase["KeyQ"] = "popping"
            BKB->>Key: phase → "popping"
            Key->>CSS: class "bubble-popping" (scale 1→1.3→0, 200ms)
            CSS-->>User: 👁️ 泡泡爆裂缩放动画

            BKB->>Particle: render <ParticleBurst config={keyId, x, y, color, count:20}>
            Particle->>Particle: 生成 20 个随机 Particle
            Particle->>CSS: 20 × @keyframes particleFly (各方向飞溅)
            CSS-->>User: 👁️ 粒子飞溅 + 渐隐

            Note over BKB: 200ms timeout
            BKB->>BKB: keysPhase["KeyQ"] = "respawning"
            BKB->>Key: phase → "respawning"
            Key->>CSS: class "bubble-respawning" (scale 0→1, opacity 0→1, 1200ms)
            CSS-->>User: 👁️ 按键缓慢再生

            Note over Particle: 600ms 后 animationend
            Particle->>BKB: onComplete() → 移除 ParticleBurst

            Note over BKB: 1200ms timeout (再生完成)
            BKB->>BKB: keysPhase["KeyQ"] = "idle"
            BKB->>Key: phase → "idle"
            Key->>CSS: class "bubble-idle" (弹跳动画恢复)
            CSS-->>User: 👁️ 泡泡恢复弹跳

            BKB->>BKB: popCount++
        end

        Browser->>Browser: keyup { code: "KeyQ" }
        Browser->>HookMap: activeKeys.delete("KeyQ")
    end

    %% ==================== 流程2: 鼠标点击爆破 ====================
    rect rgb(10, 30, 30)
        Note over User,CSS: 流程2 — 鼠标点击触发爆破
        User->>Key: 点击 BubbleKey "KeyW"
        Key->>Key: phase === "idle"? 是 → 继续
        Key->>BKB: onPop("KeyW")
        Note over BKB,CSS: 同流程1 爆破处理（音效 + 动画 + 粒子 + 再生）
    end

    %% ==================== 流程3: 鼠标拖拽连环爆 ====================
    rect rgb(40, 30, 10)
        Note over User,CSS: 流程3 — 鼠标拖拽连环爆
        User->>Key: mousedown 在 KeyA
        Key->>BKB: onPop("KeyA") （第一键爆破）
        Note over BKB: 同流程1 爆破处理

        HookDrag->>HookDrag: isDragging = true
        HookDrag->>HookDrag: poppedThisDrag = Set{["KeyA"]}

        loop 用户拖动鼠标
            User->>Browser: mousemove (高频)
            Browser->>HookDrag: mousemove event
            HookDrag->>HookDrag: requestAnimationFrame 节流
            HookDrag->>HookDrag: 遍历 keyElements Map
            loop 每个按键 getBoundingClientRect
                HookDrag->>Key: rect = el.getBoundingClientRect()
                alt 鼠标坐标在 rect 内 AND keyId NOT IN poppedThisDrag
                    HookDrag->>HookDrag: poppedThisDrag.add(keyId)
                    HookDrag->>BKB: onPop(keyId) （连环爆）
                    Note over BKB: 同流程1 爆破处理（音效 + 动画 + 粒子）
                else 不在范围内或已爆过
                    Note over HookDrag: 跳过
                end
            end
        end

        User->>Browser: mouseup
        Browser->>HookDrag: mouseup event
        HookDrag->>HookDrag: isDragging = false
        HookDrag->>HookDrag: poppedThisDrag.clear()
        HookDrag->>HookDrag: 移除全局 mousemove/mouseup 监听
    end

    %% ==================== 流程4: 初始加载 + AudioContext 初始化 ====================
    rect rgb(20, 20, 40)
        Note over User,Audio: 流程4 — 页面加载 & AudioContext 初始化
        User->>Browser: 打开页面
        Browser->>BKB: 渲染 49 个 BubbleKey
        BKB->>CSS: 所有按键开始 bubbleFloat 弹跳（随机相位）
        CSS-->>User: 👁️ 按键矩阵微微浮动

        User->>Browser: 首次点击/按键
        Browser->>Audio: 触发 AudioContext 初始化
        Audio->>WebAudio: new AudioContext()
        Audio->>Audio: createNoiseBuffer() → 白噪声 AudioBuffer
        Audio-->>Browser: isReady = true
        Note over Audio: 后续所有 playPop() 直接合成，零加载
    end

    %% ==================== 流程5: 防连发逻辑 ====================
    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
        Note over User,HookMap: 流程5 — 按住不放不连发
        User->>KB: 按住 KeyQ 不放
        KB->>Browser: keydown "KeyQ"（首次）
        Browser->>HookMap: 首次 → 触发爆破
        Note over HookMap: activeKeys.add("KeyQ")
        KB->>Browser: keydown "KeyQ"（重复，OS 连发）
        Browser->>HookMap: activeKeys.has("KeyQ")? 是 → 忽略
        Note over HookMap: 不触发爆破

        User->>KB: 松开 KeyQ
        KB->>Browser: keyup "KeyQ"
        Browser->>HookMap: activeKeys.delete("KeyQ")
        Note over HookMap: 现在可以再次触发该键
    end
